    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ① Entry points\nThree webhooks (shared-secret header auth). Each normalizer turns whatever the source sends — WP form plugins, GHL, WooCommerce, Stripe, Riverside — into one clean shape.\n\n**Load Config** is the only node a human edits: IDs, tag→list and product→course maps. Unmapped tags/products fail loudly.",
        "width": 700,
        "height": 240,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "84832cdd-d591-5e1a-a417-5893e9ac9209",
      "name": "Note: Entry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ② Webinar opt-in\nGHL contact + tag → Zoom registrant (Zoom emails the calendar invite & reminders) → Klaviyo profile **with the join link already on it** → added to the nurture list that triggers the flow.",
        "width": 1680,
        "height": 240,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1ca313b4-010a-5f45-af6a-ab2374548712",
      "name": "Note: Optin",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        940,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ③ Purchase → course access\nFind-or-create the WordPress student, grant each LearnDash course, tag 'enrolled' in GHL, fire Klaviyo 'Course Enrolled' (onboarding flow; exits the webinar nurture).",
        "width": 2160,
        "height": 170,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "063dc86b-d010-5379-b2a3-93b0a5a3e15b",
      "name": "Note: Enroll",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        940,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ④ Recording → replay\nRiverside recording ready → attendance from Zoom → members-only replay post in WordPress → one Klaviyo 'Replay Ready' event per registrant with `attended` true/false.",
        "width": 1440,
        "height": 170,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "1fe2910d-e500-5419-a0e9-385d0bc6af49",
      "name": "Note: Replay",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        940,
        780
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⑤ Nothing fails silently\nEvery API step retries 3× (3 s apart). If it still fails, the **Student Journey · Error Alerts** workflow posts to Slack + email with the failing node and a one-click link to the execution. All writes are upserts / idempotent (Klaviyo `unique_id`, WP slug), so “Retry” is always safe.",
        "width": 700,
        "height": 200,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "2e11759a-fb21-588e-a7e6-e30fab7c17ff",
      "name": "Note: Errors",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
